<title>UK: Brent cargo kept by Exxon - trade.</title>
<headline>Brent cargo kept by Exxon - trade.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-05-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>One of Tuesday's Brent cargoes was kept by Exxon before the five o' clock deadline, traders said.</p>
<p>The cargo, due to load June 11-13, was the only one in the original June loading schedule.</p>
<p>Another cargo, originally set to load in the June 9-11 loading range, was deferred to June 11-13 and kept early by Phibro. This cargo was then sold on to another trader at a firm July Brent +9 cents.</p>
<p>--London Newsroom +44 171 542 8978</p>
